<!--Post: 10811--><!--Time: 1110237204-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10811"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Thinker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Thinker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 3:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That Dillons parking lot is about 3 miles from where her body was found. It is on a main thoroughfare through town, that leads to K61 highway, which merges with Hwy 50 about a mile from the dumping sight.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
