<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13965"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tulip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tulip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 16, 2005 - 12:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->For those of you who haven&#39;t heard, the DNA evidence has been compared to Rader and it is NOT a match.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13965-->
<!--Post: 13967--><!--Time: 1124227425-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13967"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, August 16, 2005 - 2:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks for that info Tulip. I&#39;ve been wondering about that for months now. So much time has now passed that any DNA on unsolved murders in existence has had time to be checked and still it remains 10 known victims. <BR>Will 10 be the final figure?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
